{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1076854-early-subtitles-of-existing-gamelines","id":1076854,"title":"Early subtitles of existing gamelines","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-12T01:43:27-07:00","id":1076854,"title":"Early subtitles of existing gamelines","content":"Hello! I'm not sure if I have right to ask such a thing, because my question is addressed directly to developers, but I was always wondered: what <i>alternative </i>subtitles of existing gamelines was considered before you decided to give a Vampire the subname Requiem, Mummy - the subname Curse, et cetera. Hope it is normal to ask this question!<br /> <br /> \u200bP.S.: English is not my native language. Sorry if my topic looks clumsy in some parts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13265-horus","name":"Horus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T02:35:02-07:00","id":1076868,"title":"","content":"The only one I'm aware of is CofD Demon, which wasn't &quot;the Descent&quot; when we were writing it, but changed in Development.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T02:41:19-07:00","id":1076870,"title":"","content":"Sometimes I like to pretend it was &quot;Mummy the Descent&quot; since it's the foundation of their existence and major mechanic, but was changed because demons <i>descend</i> from Heaven and mummies are <i>cursed</i>, you know like Curse of the Mummy titles","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T02:49:59-07:00","id":1076873,"title":"","content":"Heartfelt thanks for answers! Mr. Brookshaw, can I ask what was the supposed name of Demon - of course, if it's appropriate.<br /> \u200bReseru, so Mummy was &quot;the Descent&quot; from the start?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13265-horus","name":"Horus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T03:05:02-07:00","id":1076881,"title":"","content":"No, Mummy was always the Curse. It was out for a year or more before Demon's name changed. <br /> <br /> Not my place to say what Demon's name was.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","